---
// Decorator: for grid-cell card components (WorkGalleryCard, WorkOverlayCard,
// WorkMiniCard) that have no intrinsic width of their own — they're sized by
// their live CSS grid parent (WorksStrip.astro, work.astro, RelatedWork.astro
// all use a 2/3-column responsive grid). Captured under plain `.container`
// with no grid, a lone card stretches/collapses to the full container width
// instead of a grid-cell fraction, producing false pixel-check size
// mismatches. A single child in a 3-column grid occupies only the first
// cell (auto-placement, no span), so this reproduces the real column width
// without needing sibling cards.
---

<div class="container">
  <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:gap-8">
    <slot />
  </div>
</div>
